","text":"パリ大好きになったー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-227.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エッフェル塔！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ詳しくは言えないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリと言えば！みたいなところもたくさん行ったーo(><)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空き時間にルーブル美術館も行ってきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと厳かな感じかと気構えてたけど、思ったよりカジュアルだった...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モナリザ、カナの婚礼、ナポレオンの戴冠式、ミロのヴィーナス、ハンムラビ法典、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を中心にみたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだけ？と思うかもだけど、ルーブルほんと広かった...脚がパンパン(@_@)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、ヴェルサイユ宮殿にも行ったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヴェルサイユに行くまでのルートでコンコルド広場も通った(T^T)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルーブルとヴェルサイユ宮殿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両方に ナポレオンの戴冠式があるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある１人の女の人の服が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルーブルとヴェルサイユでは色違いなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな説があるみたいだけど、その違いを自分の目で見比べられたって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても貴重な経験がで